# Windows batch scripts MUST be stored CRLF in the repo blobs.
# raw.githubusercontent.com serves the raw blob, and curl'd deploy.bat
# must stay CRLF: cmd.exe label resolution (call :label / goto :label)
# is unreliable on LF-only files - it died with "cannot find the batch
# label specified - RefreshPath" (2026-10-14, user Du's machine).
# "-text" disables all EOL conversion so the blob keeps the CRLF bytes.
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.ps1 -text
